        DescriptionText:
          ClassType1: TEXT
          String: |-
            Takes a Surface Position and displaces vertices according to a sine wave. 
            
            The direction of the wave is controlled with the Wave Axis, and the amount the vertices are moved in each dimension is controlled by Displacement Amount. 
            
            The number of waves is controlled by Frequency, and how fast they are animated is controlled by Speed.
